    "description": "Data presented in the publication J. Lucht et al \"Phase retrieval beyond the homogeneous object assumption for X-ray in-line holographic imaging\", Optics Express (2026), https://doi.org/10.1364/OE.596620. This repository contains the normalized holographic intensity patterns (in-line holograms) of a mixture of silica and polystyrene beads measured at the G\u00f6ttingen Instrument for Nano-Imaging with X-rays (GINIX) at the P10 beamline at the PETRA III storage ring at DESY, Hamburg.",
